mail: liveness of web could not be established; queued durably as recovery only - the recipient must drain its inbox to read this, and may never do so
  live delivery NOT confirmed - do not wait for a reply, recover:
    fno agent session peek web     # did it land? a busy peer may have queued it
    fno agent session resume web   # wakes it (claude) or resumes it (other harnesses)
    fno agent session attach web   # drive it yourself (claude)
    fno agent mail admin withdraw <id> # retract the queued copy FIRST
    fno agent mail send web '<message>'  # then re-send
  a withdraw that refuses because the recipient already claimed
  the message is telling you it LANDED. Stop there: re-sending on
  top of that is the double delivery this ladder exists to avoid.